direction: down

user: 用户行为：填写 request，提交任务
scheduler: Quota 检查 / Scheduler
job: 训练任务运行
usage: 实际资源使用（周期性采样）
score: Usage Score / User Reputation
quota: 下一轮 Quota 系数

user -> scheduler: Resource Request
scheduler -> job: 分配资源
job -> usage: 采样
usage -> score: 按任务聚合
score -> quota: 周期性刷新
quota -> user: 改变下一轮申请策略 {
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}

usage.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
usage.style.stroke-width: 2
score.style.stroke: "#f59e0b"
score.style.bold: true
quota.style.stroke: "#dc2626"
quota.style.bold: true
